@startuml
title Sequence Diagram - UC15 Quan ly ngon ngu

actor "Admin / SuperAdmin" as Actor
participant "Presentation Layer\nWebAdminUI - LanguagePage va LanguageModal" as UI
participant "Business Logic Layer\nLanguagesController + LanguageService" as Business
participant "Data Access Layer\nLanguageRepository + DbContext" as DataAccess
database "Database" as Database

Actor -> UI: Mo trang ngon ngu
UI -> Business: Gui yeu cau doc tat ca ngon ngu
Business -> DataAccess: Doc danh sach ke ca bi tat
DataAccess -> Database: Doc Language
Database --> DataAccess: Tra danh sach
DataAccess --> Business: Tra du lieu
Business --> UI: Hien thi danh sach

Actor -> UI: Chon tao, sua hoac xoa
UI -> Business: Gui yeu cau thay doi
Business -> Business: Kiem tra quyen AdminOnly
Business -> DataAccess: Doc ngon ngu hien co
DataAccess -> Database: Kiem tra code va tham chieu
Database --> DataAccess: Tra ket qua
alt Code duoc ho tro, khong trung va du lieu hop le
  Business -> DataAccess: Ghi thay doi Language
  DataAccess -> Database: Tao, cap nhat hoac xoa
  Database --> DataAccess: Xac nhan
  Business --> UI: Tra ket qua
  UI --> Actor: Cap nhat danh sach
else Khong co quyen, code sai, bi trung hoac khong ton tai
  Business --> UI: Tra thong bao loi
  UI --> Actor: Hien thi loi
end
@enduml
